    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あれ、だありん……。じゃなくて、えへへ、転校生くん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「やっほ。君も、まだ起きてたんだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……おっと、窓を開けないと声は届かないか。ちょっと待ってね、んしょ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そっちも窓開けてよ～、お喋りしよ。眠れなくて退屈なんだよ、お願いだよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/evolved/1006"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「よしよし、やっと声が聞けた。こちら三波なつみです、どうぞ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「今日はほんと、何だか大騒ぎだったね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「イルミネーションが目の奥にチカチカしてる感じで、ぜんぜん眠れないよ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「明日は、さあやちゃんのバレーの大会があるから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「応援しにいく予定だし、早く寝て早く起きないといけないんだけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ななちゃんなんか、もう『ぐっすり』だよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「切り替え早いの羨ましいなぁ、わたしはいつまでもズルズル引きずっちゃうから……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うん。ななちゃん、今日はウチに泊まってるの。朝起きれないから起こして～、とか言っちゃってさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「このまま眠れなかったら、わたしのほうが寝坊しちゃいそう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そうそう、お父さんが出張中だからさ。そっちの部屋で寝てるよ～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ななちゃんも寝てなかったらお喋りしようかなって思って、さっき部屋を覗いたんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んもう、笑っちゃうぐらい熟睡してるの。お腹だしちゃってさ、よだれ垂らしてさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「悔しいから、写メってスマホの待ち受けにしちゃった♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「見て見て。ちょうど今日、遊園地で撮った写真とか見直してたんだ～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あっという間って感じだったけど、振り返ってみると充実した一日だったね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君も、お疲れさま。あの、わたしたちほんとお邪魔しちゃってごめんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「でも、一緒に遊園地を巡れて嬉しかったよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「むかぁし、わたしと君と家族みんなで遊園地に行ったよね。覚えてないかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしと君だけ迷子になって、でも気にせずにアトラクションいっぱい楽しんだよね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あとで、あんずさんが珍しくすっごい怒ったよね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「転校生くん、『わたしのぶん』までお仕置きされて、二回も三回も頭を叩かれちゃってさ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「嬉しかったよ。いつも、君はわたしを守ってくれたよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「楽しくして、幸せにして、笑顔にしてくれてた。それを、思いだせた気分……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あのころから、今でもずっと、君のことが大好きだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「って、何言ってんだろ……。あはは、ごめん忘れて。どうも、頭が回んないや」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちょうどよく眠たくなってきたし、わたしはもうベッドで休むね。君も、あんまり夜更かししちゃ駄目だよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「夜は、冷えこむし。窓を閉めて、あったかくして寝てね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「おやすみなさい。夜遅いのに相手してくれてありがとうね、ダーリン♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……あっ、そうそう。明日、よかったら君も一緒にさあやちゃんの応援に行く？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「今さらすぎるし、他に予定があるならいいけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どうして最初から誘わなかったのか～って、感じだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ごめんね。まだ、君がこうしてそばにいるのが不思議なの。ずっと、離ればなれだったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君がいない間は寂しかったよ、ずっと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「窓を開けても、誰もいない、がらんとした部屋があるだけでさ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だから夜とか、君の部屋の窓が明るいと、すごく『ほっ』としちゃう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「おっと。また長話になっちゃいそう、つづきは明日……起きてからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「これから先、まだいくらでも、こうしてお喋りできるもんね。それが、とっても嬉しいよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「遊園地のイルミネーションも、すっごくすっごく綺麗だったけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「こうして、わたしが独り占めできる……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君の部屋の窓明かりも、これ以上ないぐらい『幸せな感じ』だよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「じゃあね、今度こそおやすみ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「寂しい、眠れない夜はまた部屋の明かりをつけて……。窓を開けて、『ふたりきり』でお喋りしようね♪」"
  }
]